### Weighings — PHYSICAL DELETE (expects 200 OK; net weight removed from the lot; 409 if the lot lacks that stock)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@id = 1

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/weighings/{{id}}

### Collections — PHYSICAL DELETE of a collection with weighings (expects 409 Conflict)
@collectionId = 1

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/collections/{{collectionId}}
